# Semantics ch. 8's tick 0 and tick 1 byte for byte; then moved by pick ST: the `rebuild`'s dynamic is structural, its value after m the snapshot S(m-1), so it holds the /etc/hostnam generation (built at 1) only after 2, when it is published, and `@Flatten` (after n, the inner its outer held after n-1, adopted at the end of the tick it moved, ch. 7) reads that generation from 3: the label lags the watch by two ticks, where the book, whose rebuild dynamic takes the newborn's result after its birth tick, has one.
